    "description": {
      "value": "The visages of beasts are carved into the painted wood of a beast staff, with a large head on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a staff. While wielding the staff while you have it prepared, you're affected by speak with animals. If you have Wild Empathy, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on checks using it.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- - **Cantrip:** gouging claw\n- - **1st:** magic fang, pest form\n- - **2nd:** animal form, enlarge"
